e.  It is hoped that this will lead to better outcomes for those struggling with addiction.\n\n***\n\nThe situation raises important questions about public health and criminal justice reform.  It also highlights the complexities of addressing drug use in a responsible manner. People of all **age**s are impacted in this **country**.  It’s vital to consider how best to help those who **eat** and experience difficulties.  Simple **shopping** trips can become perilous.  Even a slight difference in **tongue** can change understanding.\n\nP.S. This situation is complex and evolving. More information will be needed to fully evaluate its impact.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Oregon", "logprob": -0.005666265729814768}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.15041013062000275}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁experiment", "logprob": -1.1491578817367554}, {"token": "▁with", "logprob": -0.008087506517767906}, {"token": "▁decriminal", "logprob": -0.003773474832996726}, {"token": "izing", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": "▁drugs", "logprob": -0.01173627469688654}, {"token": "▁ends", "logprob": -0.042642541229724884}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -2.23060941696167}, {"token": "▁Sunday", "logprob": -0.0357021763920784}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.2844575345516205}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.0016664678696542978}, {"token": "▁new", "logprob": -0.0040551344864070415}, {"token": "▁law", "logprob": -0.0017396567855030298}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.013891676440834999}, {"token": "▁HB", "logprob": -4.339123915997334e-05}, {"token": "4", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.537788011773955e-05}, {"token": "▁will", "logprob": -0.07885603606700897}, {"token": "▁reinstate", "logprob": -0.018019307404756546}, {"token": "▁criminal", "logprob": -5.602820692729438e-06}, {"token": "▁penalties", "logprob": -0.08151783049106598}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -3.44508